  "title": "Grandma Randolph&#39;s Noodles",
  "description": "Serve these rustic noodles in place of mashed potatoes with a Thanksgiving dinner, or put them in a turkey carcass soup the day after the feast. Allow a minimum of two hours after cutting for these noodles to dry.",
